    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a desktop pet application.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this version, you can enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A freely roaming black cat that interacts with your mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pinball mini-game where you collect points and earn rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A poker mini-game to strategize and gain more points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 100 digital artworks to discover and display.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden memes and artworks waiting to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summonable idle friend characters who appear on your desktop and work alongside you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It runs as a floating desktop app, adding a touch of fun and artistic flair to your daily tasks.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a desktop pet application.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this version, you can enjoy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A freely roaming black cat that interacts with your mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pinball mini-game where you collect points and earn rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A poker mini-game to strategize and gain more points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of 100 digital artworks to discover and display.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden memes and artworks waiting to be found.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summonable idle friend characters who appear on your desktop and work alongside you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It runs as a floating desktop app, adding a touch of fun and artistic flair to your daily tasks.</p>",
    "short_description": "Here's a black cat and a door\u2014sometimes the cat will chase your mouse cursor around. The door leads to different places. Open it to check today's weather, invite idle friends to hang out on your screen, or go play some pinball and collect a few paintings.",
